      "content": "<h3>주차장 현황 및 주차 면수</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"text\" summary=\"주차장 현황 및 주차 면수에 대한표이며 선상주차장, 광장주차장에 대한 제공\">\r\n\r\n\t<caption>주차장 현황 및 주차 면수 \r\n\r\n\t</caption>\r\n\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">주차장 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\r\n\t<tbody class=\"text_center\">\r\n\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"cursor: default;\">선상A주차장   567면(일반 549면, 장애인 18면)</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>선상B주차장   50면(일반 48면, 장애인 2면)   </p>\r\n\r\n                    <p>북항주차장   65면(일반 61면, 장애인 4면)   </p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>주차요금</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"text\" summary=\"주차요금에 대한내용이며 구분, 기본(30분), 추가10분, 1일주차, 월정기, 기타에 대한 제공\">\r\n\r\n\t<caption>주차요금 \r\n\r\n\t</caption>\r\n\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">구분 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">기본(30분) \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">추가 10분 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">1일 주차 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">기타  \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">비고  \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\r\n\t<tbody class=\"text_center\">\r\n\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">선상A,B \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">1,500원 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">500원 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">18,000원 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"cursor: default;\">6시간 이후 </p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"cursor: default;\">1일 요금 적용</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"cursor: default;\">열차이용고객30% 할인</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"cursor: default;\">(승차권,코레일톡 확인)</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>주차장기타서비스</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"text\" summary=\"주차장기타서비스에 대한내용이며 구분, 이용시간, 요금, 연락처, 비고를 제공\">\r\n\r\n\t<caption>주차장기타서비스 \r\n\r\n\t</caption>\r\n\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div editfield=\"1\">구분 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">이용시간 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">요금 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">연락처 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"cursor: default;\" editfield=\"1\">비고 \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t</th>\r\n\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\r\n\t<tbody class=\"text_center\">\r\n\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\